          <div class="flex-16 flex-center">
            <h2 class="_40px-head text-align-center max-width-550">Innovorder's founders <span class="gradient-text">talk about the future.</span></h2>
            <p class="text-size-18px text-align-center max-width-750">Because a restaurant is first and foremost a human adventure, we make AI a discreet ally that frees up time for what really matters: the customer experience.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ai-quote-wrap">
            <div class="quote-img-wrap"><img src="/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/68e9241b9577c619b9fe34f7_Je%CC%81ro%CC%82me%20PP%201.avif" loading="lazy" alt class="quote-img"></div>
            <div class="flex-20 flex-left">
              <div class="ai-quote-icon w-embed"><svg width="45" height="35" viewBox="0 0 45 35" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
