              <p class="text-size-24px text-weight-light c1">Artificial intelligence isn't just another fad, it's a powerful groundswell that's forcing us to adapt and transform ourselves at a speed we've never seen before.</p>
              <div class="text-size-24px c2"><span class="text-color-red"><strong>Jérôme Varnier,</strong></span><strong> CEO of Innovoder</strong></div>
            </div>
