    </div><div class="section-base">
      <div class="container-1280">
        <div class="ai-text-box">
          <div class="flex-24">
            <h2 class="_40px-head"><span class="gradient-text">Artificial intelligence at the service of people.</span></h2>
            <div class="ai-text-rt w-richtext">
              <p><strong>At Innovorder, artificial intelligence is not an end in itself: it's a lever in the service of people.</strong></p>
              <p>‍</p>
              <p>A lever for restaurateurs, their teams and their customers. A lever for streamlining, simplifying and improving.</p>
              <p>‍</p>
              <p>We envision a future where every restaurateur, whatever their size or location, has access to intelligent tools that free up time, reduce constraints and create opportunities.</p>
              <p>‍</p>
              <p>Where every customer enjoys a richer, more personalized experience, without unnecessary friction, from the moment they place their order to the final smile. </p>
              <p>‍</p>
              <p><strong>Behind every visible success lies an invisible foundation.</strong></p>
              <p>‍</p>
              <p>This robust, reliable and scalable architecture enables restaurateurs to :</p>
              <ul role="list">
                <li>reduce friction in all flows: procurement, inventory management, preparation, service, payment, collection,</li>
                <li>accelerate growth: automation, data, predictive intelligence,</li>
                <li>take advantage of digital opportunities without making operations more complex or cumbersome.</li>
              </ul>
              <p>‍</p>
              <p>Our mission is simple: to support the foodservice industry in its digital transformation, based on two pillars: strong human support and cutting-edge technology in the age of artificial intelligence.</p>
              <p>‍</p>
              <p><strong>We want to be the trusted partner of restaurateurs who dare to think big:</strong></p>
              <ul role="list">
                <li>those who want to offer a memorable, consistent, fast, human customer experience,</li>
                <li>those who believe that technology should relieve operational stress, not create it,</li>
                <li>those who want to turn every meal, every table, every interaction into a moment of emotion and conviviality.</li>
              </ul>
              <p>‍</p>
